The starting point for our proof technique is the use of the chain rule of the conditional mutual information, first used in this context in~\cite{brandao11} and further exploited in~\cite{brandao13b}. More precisely, we will use the quantum relative entropy defined as
\begin{align}
D(\rho\|\sigma):=
\begin{cases} \tr(\rho \log \rho) - \tr(\rho \log \sigma) & \mbox{if } support(\rho)\subseteq support(\sigma) \\ \infty & \mbox{otherwise} \end{cases},
\end{align}
