To this end, consider for a fixed $\alpha>0$ and $t:=\|x^*\|_1$, the linear program
\beq\label{eq:iprimal}
\min_{x\in\RR^n}  \sum_{i\in L}\alpha x_i-\sum_{i\in U}\alpha x_i,\quad\text{s.t.}~Ax=b,~\|x\|_1\le t.
\eeq
