Then, $\g_k$ and $\mu_k$ satisfy Assumption \ref{assum:sequences} with $\lambda_{\min}$ and $\alpha$ in \eqref{equ:valuesForAssumH_k} and $\mu_k$ satisfies \eqref{eqn:mu-k}.}
