\begin{itemize}
\item [\sf (A2)] The mass parameterization is $h(r)=r^2$ and the metric on $\Omega^*$ is of the form Eq.~\eqref{eq:metric} with $(\alpha(r),\beta(r))=(\alpha,\beta/r^2)$ for some $\alpha,\beta>0$.
