\nbr{\xb_{t+1} - \ttxb}_{\ttHb} \leq 3\cbr{ \frac{L}{\lambda_{\min}^{3/2}}\|\xb_t-\ttxb\|_{\ttHb}^2 + \|\Ib - \Hb_t^{-1/2}\tHb_t \Hb_t^{-1/2}\| \cdot \|\xb_t - \ttxb\|_{\ttHb}}.
