Applying the nonexpansiveness of the proximity operator, \cref{prox-prop}, and $\iprod{\Fnor(\sz^m)}{\sx^n-\sx^m} \leq \frac{\lambda}{4} \norm{\Fnor(\sz^m)}^2 + \lambda^{-1} \norm{\sx^n-\sx^m}^2$, we have
%
\[
    \psi(\sx^n)\leq  \psi(\sx^m) + \tfrac{\Llambda}{2} \norm{\sz^n-\sz^m}^2 + \tfrac{\lambda}{4} \norm{\Fnor(\sz^m)}^2.
\]
