Invoking \Cref{lem:est-err} (for $\norm{\sz^n-\sz^m}$) and $(a+b)^2\leq 2a^2+2b^2$,  we obtain
%
\[
    \psi(\sx^n)\leq  \psi(\sx^m) + (4\Llambda\tau_{m,n}^2+\tfrac{\lambda}{4}) \norm{\Fnor(\sz^m)}^2 + 4\Llambda \scs_{m,n}^2.
