where $\vu_k \triangleq \vF(\tilde{\vz}_k) -\vF({\vz_k})$, $\vs_k \triangleq \tilde{\vz}_k-\vz_k$, and $\tilde{\vz}_k$ is the auxiliary iterate in Subroutine~\ref{alg:ls}. 
