B))^S)}$ such that
$g(\widetilde{q})<0$.

\item
\label{p:existii+}
$g$ is convex and lower semicontinuous.
\item 
\label{p:existii}
$C$ is a nonempty convex compact set.
\item 
\label{p:existiii}
